1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,446
QuarantinePay makes agent purchases
verifiable.

2
00:00:04,446 --> 00:00:06,889
Buyers approve a signed intent.

3
00:00:06,889 --> 00:00:13,068
PayPal authorizes a hold while delivery
checks decide whether to capture or void.

4
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:22,278
This assistant runs Qwen three locally on
our thirty-two gigabyte Tesla V one

5
00:00:22,278 --> 00:00:22,876
hundred.

6
00:00:22,876 --> 00:00:26,114
Prompts and product text stay on this
server.

7
00:00:26,114 --> 00:00:31,077
The model can recommend an invoice
artifact, but receives no payment

8
00:00:31,077 --> 00:00:33,558
credentials or authority to spend.

9
00:00:33,558 --> 00:00:36,910
Private mode also searches our local
catalog.

10
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:41,640
PayPal receives the approved payment
fields required by its API.

11
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,148
We change the merchant after signing.

12
00:00:45,148 --> 00:00:50,432
The gateway rejects the altered intent
before any PayPal order is created.

13
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:59,048
First, the failing delivery.

14
00:00:59,048 --> 00:01:05,454
QuarantinePay creates a PayPal Sandbox
order and waits for buyer approval.

15
00:01:05,454 --> 00:01:09,891
After approval, the server authorizes one
dollar.

16
00:01:09,891 --> 00:01:12,751
Capture waits for verification.

17
00:01:12,751 --> 00:01:17,079
The invoice then fails its deterministic
arithmetic check.

18
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:22,591
The worker requests a void using the
stored authorization and request

19
00:01:22,591 --> 00:01:23,470
identifier.

20
00:01:23,470 --> 00:01:29,548
The red timeline and audit event appear
only when PayPal confirms the void.

21
00:01:29,548 --> 00:01:35,235
Signature checks, deadlines, and one-time
nonces remain enforced.

22
00:01:35,235 --> 00:01:40,766
The authorization hold provides a
verification window before settlement.

23
00:01:47,110 --> 00:01:53,820
For a valid delivery, the buyer again
approves the signed transaction and PayPal

24
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,497
authorizes the hold.

25
00:01:55,497 --> 00:02:00,950
This time, the invoice satisfies the
agreed acceptance policy.

26
00:02:00,950 --> 00:02:08,059
Quantities and prices produce the exact
approved total, and the verifier returns a

27
00:02:08,059 --> 00:02:09,360
passing result.

28
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:12,966
Only then does the worker capture the
authorization.

29
00:02:12,966 --> 00:02:17,372
The timeline turns green after PayPal
confirms completion.

30
00:02:17,372 --> 00:02:23,214
Durable operations, stable request
identifiers, and provider-state checks

31
00:02:23,214 --> 00:02:26,575
support safe recovery after interruptions.

32
00:02:26,575 --> 00:02:33,122
We independently checked the recipient,
amount, and final payment status against

33
00:02:33,122 --> 00:02:34,513
PayPal's own API.

34
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:43,471
QuarantinePay brings together local AI,
signed purchase intents, deterministic

35
00:02:43,471 --> 00:02:47,096
delivery checks, and confirmed PayPal
settlement.

36
00:02:52,050 --> 00:02:55,750
We also verified the live Channel3 path.

37
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:59,116
The fixed public seed returned eight
listings.

38
00:02:59,116 --> 00:03:03,079
All eight passed local screening, and none
were withheld.

39
00:03:03,079 --> 00:03:06,474
A follow-up search found five in our local
mirror.

40
00:03:06,474 --> 00:03:11,119
These listings are for discovery only and
cannot change checkout.
